      "text": "LEGUME POSITION IN GLOBAL FOOD SYSTEMS\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nNITROGEN CYCLE ROLE:\n  Atmosphere: 78% N₂ (unusable by most organisms)\n       │ Rhizobium symbiosis (inside root nodules)\n       ▼\n  NH₃ → amino acids → legume protein\n       │ plant residues decompose\n       ▼\n  Soil nitrogen enriched → benefits next crop"
    },
