      "text": "PROTEIN COMPLEMENTARITY:\n  Grains: high in methionine, low in lysine\n  Legumes: high in lysine, low in methionine\n  Together: complete amino acid profile\n  Classic combinations: rice+beans, dal+rice, hummus+pita, tofu+rice"
