      "text": "KEY CROPS:\n  Soybean        → 60% of plant protein in livestock feed\n  Dry beans      → 500M people's daily protein staple\n  Lentils        → Fertile Crescent staple, 9,000 BP\n  Chickpea       → Mediterranean/South Asian staple\n  Peanut         → legume, not nut; tropical staple\n```"
